						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250151">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:h1>General</reqif-xhtml:h1></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_72c51bc7-a171-4cdf-bf5d-d6b2a68fce9d" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:span style="text-decoration:underline;">Hinweise zur KSU Klassifizierung:<reqif-xhtml:br/></reqif-xhtml:span>Die KSU Klassifizierungen sind gem&#xE4;&#xDF; ORL24 Aufbewahrung von Unterlagen (Anlage &quot;Klassifizierungssystematik f&#xFC;r Unterlagen (KSU)&quot;) festzulegen:</reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;"><reqif-xhtml:li>&#x2003;Tempor&#xE4;re Arbeitsunterlagen / Ausleitungen aus RM-Tool:&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&quot;Initialklasse&quot; KSU 0.1</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>&#x2003;Alle freigegebenen Lastenheftst&#xE4;nde:&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&quot;Produktiventwicklungsunterlagen&quot; KSU 5.1</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:b>Achtung: in AVW muss das Dokument vor Freigabe den Status KSU 5.1 haben!</reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;"><reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&#x2003;</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b>Der finale Lastenheftstand, welcher die Bauteilanforderungen f&#xFC;r das Serienprodukt beschreibt: &#x2003;<reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&quot;Freigaben/dokumentationspflichtige Unterlagen f&#xFC;r das Serien-/Endprodukt&quot; KSU 5.3</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250152">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:span style="text-decoration:underline;">Notes on the Classification System for Documents (CSD):<reqif-xhtml:br/></reqif-xhtml:span>The CSD categories must be defined as per the Organizational Guideline ORL24 &quot;Retention of Documents&quot; (annex &quot;Classification System for Documents (CSD)&quot;).</reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;"><reqif-xhtml:li>&#x2003;Temporary working documents / exports from RM tool:&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&quot;Initial category&quot; CSD&#xA0;0.1</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>&#x2003;All released Performance Specification versions:&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&quot;Product development documents&quot; CSD&#xA0;5.1</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:b>Important note: In AVW, the document must have CSD&#xA0;5.1 before it can be released!</reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;"><reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i/></reqif-xhtml:b>The final Performance Specification version that specifies the part requirements for the series production product:&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:b><reqif-xhtml:i>&quot;Releases and mandatory documentation for series and end products&quot; CSD&#xA0;5.3</reqif-xhtml:i></reqif-xhtml:b></reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_5c30796a-62b4-4f7b-bdf2-c7a1f39bfcd1" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Die ORL24 des Volkswagen Konzerns ist bei der Marke Audi durch die U_014 beschrieben.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250153">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>ORL24 of the Volkswagen Group corresponds to the Audi Guideline U_014.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_44e8ed4f-0697-4184-befa-f6c22eccc4ae" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Die ORL24 des Volkswagen Konzerns ist bei der Marke Porsche durch die Porsche Richtlinie Nr. P10 beschrieben.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250154">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>ORL24 of the Volkswagen Group corresponds to Porsche Guideline no. P10.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_8c5b6341-16de-4e0f-ab80-442a1cfd7b9a" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Bei einer Ausleitung des Dokumentes in Word oder Excel, ist die KSU-Klassifizierung selbstst&#xE4;ndig durch den Autor in der Fu&#xDF;zeile des Word- bzw. Excel-Dokumentes anzupassen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250155">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>When exporting the document to Word or Excel, the author must independently adapt the CSD category in the footer of the Word or Excel document.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_15b8cac3-6214-4049-ba3d-32f6a3c107b3" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-18T08:58:54">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
