							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Along with the quotation documents, the contractor must provide the purchaser with a reliability testing strategy based on the &quot;LAH.DUM.000.R Mechatronics Process Performance Specification&quot; document.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
