							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>The contractor shall fill out the export control classification (ECC) form: Volkswagen AG (vwgroupsupply.com), sign it, and submit it to the purchaser.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
