				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_0921ef6c-854f-4128-9836-2547a4b9b743" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-17T23:38:14">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Funktionsumfang sowie m&#xF6;gliche Performanceeinschr&#xE4;nkungen der Muster m&#xFC;ssen vorab mit Volkswagen abgestimmt sein.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="24686584">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The functional scope and potential performance limits of this sample needs to be upfront aligned with Volkswagen.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_10aa1e12-a2ac-4012-9d9a-3cd51f4f4ce7" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-17T23:38:19">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Die Fertigungsmethoden f&#xFC;r diese Musterphase k&#xF6;nnen vom Serienstand (zB Werkzeuge, Anlagen...) abweichend sein, m&#xFC;ssen jedoch vorab mit Volkswagen abgestimmt sein (-&gt; Laufkarten-Freigabe durch VW)</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="24686588">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The manufacturing process for this sample phase can deviate in respect to tool usage, equipment implementation... from volume scale manufacturing. Deviations must however be upfront agreed upon by VW (-&gt; lot travel card release by VW).</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_fbe68ca4-3bf7-443a-b6f3-c8c3c72b0bdf" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer muss mit dem A-Muster die Grundfunktionen gem&#xE4;&#xDF; Zielkatalog bzw. Lastenheft unter Versuchs- bzw. Laborbedingungen (VPT, fr&#xFC;he Aggregattr&#xE4;ger) der Komponente sicherstellen.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250277">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>With the A-sample, the contractor shall ensure the component&#039;s basic functions as per the target catalog and Performance Specification under testing and laboratory conditions (pre-prototype, early test mules).</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_c4b092f5-27e1-44e6-b47e-bb4f865e0333" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer muss die Funktionalit&#xE4;t der Komponente gem&#xE4;&#xDF; Einsatzzweck umsetzen und deren technische funktionale Umsetzung im A-Muster gew&#xE4;hrleisten.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250279">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>The contractor shall implement the component&#039;s functionality as per the intended use and ensure its technical, functional implementation in the A-sample.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_47cc32f6-c5f2-41d7-b046-aa19213a875e" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r die Hardware die Einbauma&#xDF;e entsprechend der Zeichnung oder nach Absprache umsetzen.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250280">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>For the hardware, the contractor shall implement the installation dimensions as per the drawing or following consultation.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_a99c6d5c-1437-4b6a-8f38-8b38937e04d7" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer kann f&#xFC;r den A-Musterstand verschiedene Herstellungsverfahren verwenden.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250322">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>For the A-sample version, the contractor can use various manufacturing methods.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_16eae786-0357-4fbb-abaa-27858c9f5565" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer muss bei der Herstellung der A-Muster, die zu verwendenden Werkstoffe, die nur teilweise endg&#xFC;ltige Serienwerkstoffe sind, mit dem Auftraggeber abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250352">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>When making the A-samples, the contractor shall agree with the purchaser on the materials to be used that are only partially final production materials.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
