							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must provide contacts that will actively work at the purchaser&#039;s development location on the individual project in question.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
