							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Die Mustermappe muss einen HW-Stand enthalten.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
