							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The direction of the current flow is defined as follows:</reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:li>Positive currents flow into the device</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Negative currents flow out of the device</reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
