				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_f44649ad-2201-4bb3-bd2b-4e4acdaca9d4" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-17T23:37:46">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_9d36d841-9775-43a3-bccd-8d7369d7fe17</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der in diesem Dokument beschriebene Siliziumkarbid-Bare Die MOSFET ist sowohl in seiner Applikations- wie auch Referenzvariante f&#xFC;r den Einsatz in einem Transfer-Molded-Leistungsmodulen f&#xFC;r Automotive-Pulswechselrichter vorgesehen. Besagte Chips m&#xFC;ssen entweder Volkswagen oder einem Dritten (z.B. Build to Print Leistungsmodul-Lohnfertiger) zur Best&#xFC;ckung mittels Pick-and-Place Anlagen in einer Leistungsmodul-Fertigungslinie zur Verf&#xFC;gung gestellt werden.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_f47ace98-290f-4967-9abb-39806afe51e8</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="24647254">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The here described silicon carbide bare die MOSFET (in both application and reference design tape out) is required for usage in automotive inverter type transfer molded power modules. The chips are provided either to Volkswagen or third party (e.g. build to print power module manufacturer) for pick and place assembly in a power module manufacturing line.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_cb7edcb9-01f5-40bf-979b-d841d1a8276a" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
