							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The tolerances of outer chip dimensions (length, width, thickness, pad geometry, edges...) must be aligned between the contractor and VW as part of the design review milestones.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
