							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p style="text-align:justify;">For the materials used, the contractor must meet the following materials requirements that apply to the purchaser:</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_db065d2f-35a3-4511-9ac0-e1b464abf1b1" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss elektrische Isolationseigenschaften nach PV1015 erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250640">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must fulfill electrical insulation properties as per Test Standard PV&#xA0;1015.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_6473b012-982b-4556-9533-96aac716fef3" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Flammschutzmittel auf Basis von rotem Phosphor darf in Polymerwerkstoffen in E/E-Komponenten mit schaltenden Kontakten und bei Polymerwerkstoffen, welche in Kontakt mit Aluminium stehen, nicht verwendet werden, da das Risiko von Ablagerungen zu hochohmigen Kontakten besteht.&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:br/></reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250641">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Flame retardants based on red phosphorus shall not be used in polymer materials in E/E components with switching contacts or polymer materials, which have contact to aluminium, because there is the risk of deposits resulting in high-impedance contacts.&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:br/><reqif-xhtml:br/></reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_77a09b3b-820a-4839-9876-59088ae5ddde" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
