				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_a5974074-0cbd-4f3e-8477-c0810e354c77" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r Polyoxymethylen (POM) au&#xDF;erhalb des Fahrzeuginnenraumes die Werkstoffanforderungen nach TL 52636 erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250656">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For polyoxymethylene (POM) outside of the vehicle interior, the contractor must meet the materials requirements in TL&#xA0;52636.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_125c7c95-f883-4d2f-9eb5-de69e5b57061" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r Polyoxymethylen (POM) im Fahrzeuginnenraum die Werkstoffanforderungen nach TL 52476 erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250658">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For POM in the vehicle interior, the contractor must meet the materials requirements in TL&#xA0;52476.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_7b14f9ad-77e3-4464-a8ca-f014c519875e" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r Polyoxymethylen (POM) schlagz&#xE4;hmodifiziert die Werkstoffanforderungen nach TL 52277 erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250659">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For impact-modified POM, the contractor must meet the materials requirements in TL&#xA0;52277.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_f88a39fd-f4b3-4b65-93e4-0f50d999ab7d" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Werkstoff Polyoxymethylen (POM) darf nicht verwendet werden, wenn das Bauteil aus diesem Werkstoff einen direkten Kontakt zu einem stromdurchflossenen Leiter hat.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250660">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Polyoxymethylene (POM) material shall not be used if the part made of this material comes in direct contact with a current-carrying conductor.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_8954299d-3d46-412c-a195-dd04e6384857" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer muss Abweichungen zu diesem Kapitel &quot;Polyacetale&quot; mit der Fachabteilung &quot;Werkstofftechnik&quot; des Auftraggebers abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250661">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must agree upon deviations to this &quot;Polyacetals&quot; section with the purchaser&#039;s Materials Engineering department.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_cc7cba6e-b888-444e-a013-eb9f7c578c1f" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_9d36d841-9775-43a3-bccd-8d7369d7fe17</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Polycarbonate / -blends</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_f47ace98-290f-4967-9abb-39806afe51e8</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250663">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:h4>Polycarbonates/polycarbonate blends</reqif-xhtml:h4></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_7b09b1e8-7520-4ef0-aac7-43bae7e56984" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r Polycarbonat + Acrylnitril Butadien Styrol (PC+ABS) die Werkstoffanforderungen nach TL 52231 erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250664">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For polycarbonate + acrylonitrile butadiene styrene (PC+ABS), the contractor must meet the materials requirements in TL&#xA0;52231.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_e42097ff-85ca-4389-b11c-a4c9a6670aea" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r den Einsatz geplanten Thermoplaste (z.B. PPS, PPA, PET, etc.), ohne explizite Anforderungen durch den Auftraggeber, die folgenden Anforderungen mit der Werkstofftechnik vor B-Freigabe abstimmen und auf der Zeichnung definieren:</reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:li>Verst&#xE4;rkungsart und -gehalt in &#x25; (z.B.&#xA0;&#xA0;30&#x25; glasfaserverst&#xE4;rkt)</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Modifikatorart (z.B. schlagz&#xE4;hmodifiziert)</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Dichte nach ISO 1183</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Schmelztemperatur (DSC)</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Zugfestigkeit nach ISO 527</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Medienbest&#xE4;ndigkeit (Luft, &#xD6;l, K&#xFC;hlwasser etc.) in Abh&#xE4;ngigkeit von den jeweiligen&#xA0;&#xA0;Umgebungsbedingungen (z.B. prozentuale &#xC4;nderung der mechanischen Eigenschaften im vgl. zum Anlieferungszustand &lt;25&#x25;)<reqif-xhtml:br/><reqif-xhtml:br/><reqif-xhtml:br/></reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250665">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For thermoplastics planned for use (e.g., PPS, PPA, PET, etc.) that do not have explicit requirements by the purchaser, the contractor must agree upon the following requirements with Materials Engineering prior to the B-release and define them in the drawing:</reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:li>Reinforcement type and content as a &#x25; (e.g., 30&#x25; glass-fiber-reinforced)</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Modifier type (e.g., impact-modified)</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Density as per ISO 1183</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Melting temperature (differential scanning calorimetry [DSC])<reqif-xhtml:br/>Tensile strength as per ISO 527</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Resistance to media (air, oil, coolant, etc.) depending on the prevailing ambient conditions (e.g., percentage change of the mechanical properties compared to the as-received condition &lt; 25&#x25;)</reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_f3493139-7840-4fc3-b960-f9db18b47819" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p style="text-align:justify;">Der Auftragnehmer muss f&#xFC;r den Einsatz von Thermoplasten wie Polyamid, Polyester usw. zus&#xE4;tzlich zu den mitgeltenden Unterlagen folgende Anforderungen erf&#xFC;llen:</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250666">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p style="text-align:justify;">For the use of thermoplastics such as polyamide, polyester, etc., the contractor must meet the following requirements in addition to the applicable documents:</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_6b132c12-33c3-491c-9161-3ccebe29c0d8" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Zur Vermeidung elektrolytischer Korrosion bei bestimmten Bauelementen und Bauteilen (z.B. ungesch&#xFC;tzte Bonddr&#xE4;hte, LED, Getriebesteuerger&#xE4;te, ..) muss der Auftragnehmer den Einsatz von halogenhaltigen (J, Br, Cl, F, ..) W&#xE4;rmestabilisatoren bei Geh&#xE4;usen mit der Werkstofftechnik abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250667">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>To prevent electrolytic corrosion in certain subcomponents and parts (e.g., unprotected bond wires, LEDs, transmission control modules), the contractor must agree upon the use of halogenated (I, Br, Cl, F, etc.) thermal stabilizers in housings with Materials Engineering.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_1193aff2-0c8e-4f61-b3ac-97642a4aeff5" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Einsatz von Flammschutzmitteln auf Basis von Phosphor oder Halogenen, kann unter Umst&#xE4;nden durch Ablagerungen (z.B. &#xFC;ber Gasphase) zu hochohmigen Kontakten (z.B. bei Relais) f&#xFC;hren. Gleichzeitig besteht die Gefahr der elektrolytischen Korrosion bei Kontakt mit metallischen Komponenten im feuchtwarmen Umfeld.&#xA0;&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250668">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The use of flame retardants based on phosphorus or halogens may lead to high-impedance contacts (e.g., in relays) due to deposits (e.g., via the gas phase). At the same time, there is a danger of electrolytic corrosion in case of contact with metallic components in humid environments.&#xA0;&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_16b7d3c7-7e64-4cfe-9b85-f4f73f9fb867" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Der Auftragnehmer muss eine Verwendung der Flammschutzadditive im Vorfeld der Entwicklung mit der Werkstofftechnik abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250669">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must agree upon use of flame-retardant additives with Materials Engineering prior to development.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_11287541-5b01-470c-867f-eb3c31aa2da1" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Einsatzspezifische Verwendungshinweise in feuchter, feucht-warmer und Salz-/Laugen-belasteter Umgebung:&#xA0;<reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:li>PA6, PA66 und PA46: Starke Feuchteabh&#xE4;ngigkeit &#x2013; Einfluss der Feuchtigkeit (z.B. Volumenzunahme, Permeation) und Quellverhalten.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Polyolefine, -acetale: Neigung zum Kriechen &#x2013; &#xDC;berpr&#xFC;fung des Kriechverhaltens bei Dauerlast und max. Einsatztemperatur.</reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:li>Polyester (PBT/ Polyethylenterephthalat (PET)/ Polyurethan (PUR)): F&#xFC;r dichtende Elektronikgeh&#xE4;use ist oberhalb von Betriebstemperaturen von &gt; 80&#xB0;C und feuchter Umgebung eine hydrolysestabilisierte und laugenbest&#xE4;ndige Variante erforderlich&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250670">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Application-specific instructions for use in humid, warm humid, and salty/alkaline environments:&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p><reqif-xhtml:ul><reqif-xhtml:li>PA6, PA66, and PA46: highly humidity dependent &#x2013; influence of humidity (e.g., increase in volume, permeation) and swelling behavior.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Polyolefins, polyacetals: tendency to creep &#x2013; creepage under continuous load and max. application temperature must be checked.</reqif-xhtml:li><reqif-xhtml:li>Polyester (PBT/PET/PUR): For leaktight electronic housings, a hydrolysis-stabilized and alkaline-resistant variant is required for operating temperatures &gt; 80 &#xB0;C and a humid environment.&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:li></reqif-xhtml:ul></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_60f42039-e508-44c0-b794-09d2ccee4df3" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Wenn die Umgebung feucht, feucht-warm oder salz- oder laugenbelastet ist, dann muss der Auftragnehmer die Einsatzbereiche von Thermoplasten mit der Werkstofftechnik abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250671">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>If the environment is humid, warm and humid, salty, or alkaline, the contractor must agree upon the application areas of thermoplastics with Materials Engineering.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_e318788b-d506-4c54-98d1-0e1ec4f9cad9" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_9d36d841-9775-43a3-bccd-8d7369d7fe17</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Polymere</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_f47ace98-290f-4967-9abb-39806afe51e8</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250675">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p/><reqif-xhtml:h3>Polymers</reqif-xhtml:h3></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_0ec35636-22c5-40b7-a69f-8fc954609d2b" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Im Sinne von Ressourcenschonung gem&#xE4;&#xDF; den Konzerngrunds&#xE4;tzen ist der vermehrte Einsatz von Rezyklaten in Kunststoffen gefordert.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250676">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The Group principles on saving resources make it necessary to ensure an increased use of recycled materials in plastics.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_1c253931-9d79-48eb-badc-e6a9e3d1422e" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss dem Auftraggeber bei auf Neuware basierenden Materialkonzepten zus&#xE4;tzlich mindestens eine Alternative mit Einsatz von Rezyklaten anbieten.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250677">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For material strategies that are based on the use of new materials, the contractor must offer the purchaser at least one alternative strategy that uses recycled materials.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_41922b96-fa45-46fa-a7cf-14a4c1fe50b0" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Das Materialkonzept mit Einsatz von Rezyklaten und/oder nachwachsenden Rohstoffen muss den f&#xFC;r das Bauteil technisch maximalen Anteil enthalten.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250678">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>In the recycled-material strategy, the content of recycled materials and/or renewable raw materials in the part must be as high as technically possible.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_cc17fee1-c362-40d8-80ce-dfcfa57d12ec" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:49:02">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Um den prozess- und anwendungsgerechten Einsatz von Rezyklaten sicherzustellen und Falschverwendungen auszuschlie&#xDF;en, muss der Auftragnehmer die in der VW 50026 genannten Regelungen und Klassifizierungen erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250679">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>To ensure the use of recycled materials that are suitable for the process and the application and to exclude incorrect use, the contractor must fulfill the regulations and classifications specified in VW 50026.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_d50531f0-1861-41f1-91ca-ea5f2d661810" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:56">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss alle eingesetzten thermoplastischen Werkstoffe mit ihrer Materialbezeichnung nach VDA-Band 260, dem Handelsnamen und dem Rohstoffhersteller benennen sowie nach VW 50026 beschreiben.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250680">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For all thermoplastic materials used, the contractor must provide the corresponding materials designation as per VDA&#xA0;260, the product name, and the raw materials manufacturer and provide a description as per VW&#xA0;50026.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_53f455e9-cd97-43bf-91b7-bce1f6f30f3f" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:53">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer kann alle Granulatklassen GK1, GK2, GK3 und GK4 gem&#xE4;&#xDF; VW 50026 verwenden, wobei GK4 ausdr&#xFC;cklich bevorzugt einzusetzen ist.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250681">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor can use all granular material classes GK1, GK2, GK3, and GK4 as per VW&#xA0;50026, where the use of the GK4 must be expressly preferred.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_1a6cf8cc-70a5-49f5-87a9-56c5c6ff1608" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:50">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Mahlgut GK0 geh&#xF6;rt aktuell nicht zu den Rezyklaten und der Auftragnehmer darf diese nicht im Materialdatensystem IMDS ausweisen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250682">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>GK0 ground materials are currently not classified as recycled materials and the contractor must not indicate this in the International Material Data System (IMDS).</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_0f2c7dfb-4d38-4bae-8255-e4121af197e8" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:48">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss die Information zum Einsatz von Mahlgut in der Tabelle nach VW 50026 (Anhang A) erfassen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250683">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must record the information on the use of ground material in the table as per VW&#xA0;50026 (appendix&#xA0;A).</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_fd83ad65-6212-49b2-bac7-da3bce299eea" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:25">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Zum Rezyklatgehalt und zur Vorgeschichte des Materials sind vom Auftragnehmer dokumentarische Nachweise zu erbringen. Die Nachweise sind nach DIN EN 15343 und DIN EN 15347 zu gestalten und dem Auftraggeber auf Verlangen zur Verf&#xFC;gung zu stellen.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250684">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must provide documentation to verify the recycled-materials content and the prior history of the material. The format of the verifications must comply with DIN EN 15343 and DIN EN 15347 and must be provided to the purchaser on request.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_d34cb704-9412-4b59-868a-8fd1276583bf" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss die Verf&#xFC;gbarkeit der Rezyklat-Handelstype bis EOP und danach f&#xFC;r Ersatzteile (15 Jahre) sicherstellen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250685">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must ensure the availability of the recycled-material commercial types until the End of Production (EOP), and beyond this date for spare parts (15&#xA0;years).</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_54b6dbc3-a8ff-47a3-9ecf-217f633f981e" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:31">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>&#xC4;ndert sich die Zusammensetzung der eingesetzten Rezyklat-Handelstype (z. B. &#xC4;nderung der Mindest-Rezyklat-Gehalte, &#xC4;nderung von Anteilen in den einzelnen Granuatklassen) gem&#xE4;&#xDF; der VW 50026, muss der Auftragnehmer diese rechtzeitig anzeigen und eine erneute Bauteilpr&#xFC;fung mit dem Auftraggeber abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250688">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>If the composition of the recycled-material commercial types as per VW&#xA0;50026 is subject to changes (e.g., change of the recycled material minimum contents, change of the portions in the individual granular classes), the contractor must indicate such changes in due time and agree with the purchaser on a new part test.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_ee1ec612-6fe3-443c-8632-2ad66cf39771" LAST-CHANGE="2025-12-09T20:48:45">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss, um eine gleichleibende Materialqualit&#xE4;t zu gew&#xE4;hrleisten, sicherstellen, dass durch den Hersteller der Rezyklat-Handelstype kontinuierliche Wareneingangs- und Warenausgangskontrollen durchgef&#xFC;hrt werden.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250689">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>To ensure a consistent material quality, the contractor must make sure that the manufacturer of the recycled-material commercial types performs continuous incoming goods and outgoing goods inspections.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_86bb2a80-579a-47c5-af67-c59302af91cb" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss dem Auftraggeber auf Anfrage die gleichbleibende Materialqualit&#xE4;t nachweisen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250690">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must provide the purchaser with evidence of the consistent material quality on request.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_6a5482cc-5716-433b-8bb8-8b402956f5ec" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss die Informationen zum Rezyklateinsatz gem&#xE4;&#xDF; VW 50026 (Anhang A) im Angebot dem Auftraggeber unterschrieben best&#xE4;tigen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250691">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must confirm the information regarding the use of recycled materials as per VW&#xA0;50026 (appendix A) by signature in the quotation to the purchaser.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_e08f0290-cc90-4e51-94c8-628ccb1cfd2d" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss jeden entsprechende Materialeinsatz oder jede entsprechende Material&#xE4;nderung im Vorfeld mit dem Auftraggeber abstimmen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250692">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must agree with the purchaser on every corresponding material use and every corresponding material change in advance.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_20d4e60e-14c0-4116-a20b-46a7e68470c7" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss alle Anforderungen hinsichtlich technischer Entwicklung und Qualit&#xE4;tssicherung, unabh&#xE4;ngig vom Rezyklateinsatz, vollumf&#xE4;nglich und prozesssicher erf&#xFC;llen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250693">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must reliably meet all requirements regarding development and quality assurance to their full extent regardless of the recycled material use.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_0c13f4c6-5b90-4b8e-b953-3754ef9ab1ca" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer hat keinen Anspruch auf Anpassung oder Herabsetzung der Bauteil- bzw. Werkstoffanforderungen des Auftraggebers aufgrund des Einsatzes von Rezyklat.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250694">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor is not entitled to adapt or downgrade the part or material requirements of the purchaser due to the use of recycled materials.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_f17ce1da-43c4-4455-9850-0db3f176894c" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Der Auftragnehmer muss den Nachweis bez&#xFC;glich Rezyklateinsatz gem&#xE4;&#xDF; VW 91101 (Anhang B) und weiterf&#xFC;hrend VW 91102 innerhalb von 4 Wochen nach Vergabe im Materialdatensystem IMDS unter Angabe der zugesagten Mindestgehalte aufnehmen. Ein abweichender Zeitpunkt der Nachweiserbringung und IMDS-Bef&#xFC;llung muss mit dem Auftraggeber abgestimmt werden.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_ded8839a-d6a6-4f3f-954d-b0ccc627fc45</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250695">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The contractor must add the verification regarding the use of recycled materials as per VW&#xA0;91101 (appendix&#xA0;B) and, additionally, VW&#xA0;91102 to the International Material Data System (IMDS) within 4&#xA0;weeks after award, stating the guaranteed minimum content in each case. A deviating point in time for providing the verification and adding the data in IMDS must be agreed upon with the purchaser.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_6b03f750-7bbb-48fa-b5f9-429b77981a70" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
