							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>The static electrical on-resistance in the drain-source direction<reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;R<reqif-xhtml:sub>DS,on</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;at a junction temperature <reqif-xhtml:b>T<reqif-xhtml:sub>j</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;= 25&#xB0;C, a gate-source switching voltage <reqif-xhtml:b>V<reqif-xhtml:sub>GS</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>=18V and a continuous forward current <reqif-xhtml:b>I<reqif-xhtml:sub>DS</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>=75 A must be: 6.1m&#x3A9; (min), 7.6m&#x3A9; (median), 9.5m&#x3A9; (max)</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
