							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For the continuous gate-source switching voltage&#xA0; <reqif-xhtml:b>V<reqif-xhtml:sub>GS</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0; over lifetime, the following maximum operability range must be ensured:&#xA0; -8 &lt;= <reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;V<reqif-xhtml:sub>GS</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;&lt;= +20V&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
