							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For a limited time (10h over lifetime), transient operability at a gate-source switching voltage <reqif-xhtml:b>V<reqif-xhtml:sub>GS</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;(<reqif-xhtml:b>t<reqif-xhtml:sub>pulse</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&lt;20&#xB5;s) must be ensured within the range:&#xA0; -11V &lt;= <reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;V<reqif-xhtml:sub>GS</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;&lt;= +23V&#xA0;</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
