							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>A positive overall voltage offest for <reqif-xhtml:b>V<reqif-xhtml:sub>GS,th</reqif-xhtml:sub></reqif-xhtml:b>&#xA0;as well as a deviating distribution spread is permitted, but must be agreed upon by Volkswagen.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
