				<SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_6040dcd3-6aae-40c3-be5d-30eec3dc2eea" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28">
					<TYPE>
						<SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
					</TYPE>
					<VALUES>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>In diesem Kapitel soll verbindlich geregelt werden, welche Erf&#xFC;llungsnachweise &#xFC;ber durchgef&#xFC;hrte Pr&#xFC;fungen durch den Auftragnehmer zu erbringen sind. Die Angaben an dieser Stelle sollten nur die &#xFC;bergreifenden Vorgaben (minimaler Datenumfang der Testdokumentation bzw.&#xA0;&#xA0;Erf&#xFC;llungsnachweise, Fristen, einzubindende Abteilungen des Auftraggebers, usw.) festlegen - auf spezifische Erf&#xFC;llungsnachweise (z. B. gesonderte Parameter) einzelner Tests sollte in den jeweiligen Kapiteln eingegangen werden.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250820">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>In this section, please specify the proof-of-fulfillment documentation the contractor must provide for the tests it has carried out. The specifications given here should only include the overall specifications (minimum data scope of the test documentation or proof of fulfillment, deadlines, purchaser&#039;s departments to be involved, etc.); specific types of proof of fulfillment (e.g., special parameters) of individual tests are to be addressed in the relevant sections.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
