							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>Static stress-strain curves until failure measured in different directions &#xA0;should be provided for all fiber reinforced plastics to be used. These curves should cover a temperature range from -50&#xB0;C up to 150&#xB0;C.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
