							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>For all components the parasitic properties inductance, capacitance and resistance shall be provided.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
