							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div>Das Abk&#xFC;rzungsverzeichnis soll um ein standardisiertes Glossar erg&#xE4;nzt werden, in dem die wichtigsten Begrifflichkeiten, die innerhalb des Lastenheftes verwendet werden, einheitlich definiert sind. Dabei sollten f&#xFC;r die gleichen Sachverhalte die gleichen Begriffe aus den anderen VDA-B&#xE4;nden verwendet werden.</reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<VALUES>
								<ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
							</VALUES>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250939">
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
						<ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
							<DEFINITION>
								<ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
							</DEFINITION>
							<THE-VALUE><reqif-xhtml:div><reqif-xhtml:p>In this section, please include a standardized glossary in which the most important terms used in the Performance Specification are defined. For identical concepts, use the same terms that are used in other VDA documents.</reqif-xhtml:p></reqif-xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
						</ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
					</VALUES>
				</SPEC-OBJECT>
